# API Routes and Server Integration

## API Structure
- **Upload Endpoint**: [app/api/upload/route.ts](mdc:app/api/upload/route.ts) - handles file uploads
- **Stellar URI Endpoint**: [app/api/stellar-uri/route.ts](mdc:app/api/stellar-uri/route.ts) - generates Stellar payment URIs
- **URI Service**: [lib/stellarUriService.ts](mdc:lib/stellarUriService.ts) - Stellar URI generation logic

## API Development Guidelines
- Use Next.js App Router API routes pattern
- Implement proper error handling with appropriate HTTP status codes
- Validate request data using Zod schemas from [lib/validation.ts](mdc:lib/validation.ts)
- Return consistent JSON response formats

## Request/Response Patterns
- **POST requests**: Include request body validation
- **Error responses**: Use standard error format with message and status
- **Success responses**: Return data in consistent structure
- **File uploads**: Handle multipart/form-data requests

## Stellar Integration
- Stellar URI generation follows SEP-0007 standard
- Use utilities from [lib/stellar/](mdc:lib/stellar) for blockchain operations
- Implement proper transaction building and validation
- Handle Stellar network configurations (testnet/mainnet)

## Security Considerations
- Validate all input data
- Implement rate limiting where appropriate
- Handle file upload security (type validation, size limits)
- Sanitize data before processing